    "attributes": {
      "name": "Rainy Day Table",
      "summary": "A games cupboard on one table. Every game is data: its parts, its layout and its rules, so new ones are written, not coded. Comes with Blackjack, Chess, Snakes & Ladders and Painted Skin, a card battler made from a sketch. Play against AI opponents that are data too, with every card tracked copy by copy and full undo. Sketch your own game in the Playground (parts, areas, notes, pasted art) and the AI assistant turns it into a playable game with the bundled game authoring skill.",
